    ],
    "text": "BY Virtue of the powers vested in me by section 9 of the Civil Aviation Authority of Sri Lanka Act, No. 34 of 2002, 1, Anura Karunathilake, Minister of Ports and Civil Aviation, do by this Order amend the Schedule of the Order made under section 9 of the aforesaid Act and published in the Gazette Extraordinary, No. 2050/38 dated December 21, 2017 as follows:-",
